# 🧪 LabLens

### AI-Powered Medical Report Analysis & Visualization

LabLens is a web application that helps users understand medical laboratory reports in a simple and visual way.

Users can upload a medical report PDF, and LabLens extracts the report data, analyzes laboratory parameters, identifies abnormal values, and presents the results in an easy-to-understand interface.

> ⚠️ **Disclaimer:** LabLens is an educational/informational project and is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.

---

## ✨ Features

* 📄 Upload medical reports in PDF format
* 🔍 Extract text from medical reports
* 🤖 AI-powered data extraction using Google Gemini
* 📊 Analyze laboratory parameters
* 🟢 Identify normal values
* 🔴 Identify high/low or abnormal values
* 💡 Generate easy-to-understand insights
* 📈 Visualize report information
* 🗂️ Support medical report history
* 💻 Responsive web interface

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

