# 🌐 Local Development URLs

| Service      | URL                          |
| ------------ | ---------------------------- |
| Frontend     | `http://localhost:5173`      |
| Backend      | `http://127.0.0.1:8000`      |
| FastAPI Docs | `http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs` |

